From: SwiftVLC Maintainers <swiftvlc@localhost>
Date: Mon, 31 Aug 2026 18:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] backport audited post-pin playback and cast fixes

Apply the audited 1.1 stability backports to c833c4be0 plus SwiftVLC
patches 0001 through 0026. The upstream commits were applied in this frozen
dependency order:

  0ab833bfbb2012fabfa9f2e308261b8abaed3647
      player: fix player seeking to AB loop start while paused
  f573990efc348205a60a967a19924f5746359835
      player: fix initial seeking in AB loop policy
  ef2f3434c4b10784b612dbfac402c637ce71703a
      player: pass a valid date to the PLAYING timer event
  2b807d98b2ba8733dee502926401b95853194f59
      transcode: unload the decoder before cleaning fmt_in
  2febc7486de3985506243cc4fae36a3287b58c50
      input: decoder: unload the packetizer before cleaning its fmt_in
  de592342d31900eb9c85de97ad1feb5879f718fc
      chromecast: Add duration for streams
  8fbd8560ef1bed8546b14c88e08f98c1dc5decad
      sout: chromecast: fix CLOSE json message parsing
  37afe71a69684c7fe594934ad0dca4542a48cf19
      sout: chromecast: avoid unecessary string copies
  5efe99a912ce3ebc9d62829e91b0aed5280345ba
      sout: chromecast: fix exposed URL formatting
  8bc99a65e253aae5d4c687a33a76c916c521db77
      chromecast: Remove invalid attribute
  39e76682953ffd5357d0ee06e3b5a79512c3118d
      chromecast: Improve stream type detection

The six Chromecast commits are one atomic protocol group. 37afe's null-safe
json_get_str_view is kept in a production header shared by every namespace
handler and the linked regression probe. 5efe's RFC 3986 composer is adapted
around patch 0001's non-throwing communication failure and isConnected()
contract.

The URL boundary rejects scoped/link-local/loopback/unspecified/multicast IPv6,
unreachable IPv4 classes, and their IPv4-mapped IPv6 equivalents before
artwork/content URLs or LOAD. Wrapper-generated artwork metadata records its
published URL, restores the original source before route invalidation, and
regenerates it after a successful reinit. 8bc's invalid autoplay member stays
removed.

DEMUX_GET_LENGTH is queried through a production helper with both output
arguments. Failure or unknown becomes VLC_TICK_INVALID, every successful live
source (including a positive seek-window duration) becomes
INPUT_DURATION_INDEFINITE, and only finite non-live media retains its duration.
The cast adaptation preserves patch 0001's ownership and failure contracts.

The decoder backports unload their modules before owner-owned fmt_in storage is
cleared. ef2f3434 supplies the valid resume epoch consumed by patch 0014's
stale-pause filter.

Intentionally excluded: 46c85, 853d, and c949/52a. The 6c097 VSBD recovery
change is also excluded: it must be adapted only after the final 0027 strict
frame-step display/submission context is frozen.

Validation is source- and production-linked-probe backed by
scripts/validate-post-pin-stability.sh. The probe compiles VLC's JSON grammar,
tokeniser, json_get_str(), URL composer, and the exact Cast duration, artwork,
and protocol helpers; it does not substitute a handwritten JSON model. No
libVLC artifact or generated source is part of this patch.
